{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"Divide your advertising expenditure by the number of visits, then multiply by 1,000. For example, $10 multiplied by the number of visits 1,000 gives you CPM $10. The currency depends on which currency you used to spend.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"cpm-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"ru","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"cpm-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["cpm-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"ru","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Разделите рекламные расходы на количество посещений, а затем умножьте на ZXQPH0000QXZ. Например, сумма $ZXQPH0001QXZ, умноженная на количество посещений ZXQPH0002QXZ, дает CPM $ZXQPH0003QXZ. Валюта зависит от того, какую валюту вы использовали для расходов.","record_id":"2425c6e28d6cc83d98890d9a57cdec44b3316ee99b91f7dc879438fc0d20454e","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40658885003","seconds":2.995880381875004,"source":"Divide the ad spend by the number of impressions, then multiply by 1,000. For example, $10 over 1,000 impressions gives a CPM of $10. The currency is whatever you used for spend.","source_commit":"eb6b1a93248bb554a61ee97166d91f6524e72a78","source_hash":"c14434161a5361c1ae7b3ae1ac78be90ef1a6cb394b485d83f55558fad116f25","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Разделите рекламные расходы на количество посещений, а затем умножьте на 1,000. Например, сумма $10, умноженная на количество посещений 1,000, дает CPM $10. Валюта зависит от того, какую валюту вы использовали для расходов.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
